Description: @DESCRIPTION@
 ColorPicker is a simple but powerful color picker: RGB and HSV,
 hexadecimal and decimal codes, an on-screen color picker, color filters,
 web-safe and random colors, a color combiner and a tool that lists all
 the colors of an image. English, French, Spanish and Norwegian.
 .
 This package uses the Java runtime of the system (Java 17 or newer).
 The "@CONFLICTS@" package contains the same program with its own Java
 runtime.
